+/-! Branches on a plain computed condition: source branch values (#140, CB-11).
+
+The parameter branch values (`parameter_source_branch_values`, `Calls.parameter_wide_*`,
+`parameter_branch_values_last`) use `defInst? c = none` only to exclude the comparison case of
+`is_nonzero_cmp` (`stock_original_select_condition_calls`) and the bit-test rules of
+`lower_branch` (`parameter_selected`). `PlainSource` excludes both for a computed condition, so
+the same proofs go through with `PlainSource` in place of the parameter premise. The scalar
+nonzero emitter needs only the condition's wide type. The `cbnz` emission demands the condition,
+so the guarded post-body frame holds it in a register, whether it is a parameter or a result of
+any dominating statement. -/
